WEBVTT

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:07.210
I'm Nagi Sanzenin.

00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:10.730
People say I'm spoiled since
 I'm the heiress to a huge fortune,

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:14.200
Nagi Sanzenin

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:14.200
but I haven't the slightest intention 
of settling for such circumstances.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.530
I will take hold of my own future.

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:19.520
I spend my days working hard 
toward becoming a manga author.

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:21.970
Then you should actually draw some manga.

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:23.740
You just don't get it.

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:26.750
Constant stimulation of all kinds 
is important to manga authors.

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:31.760
I am by no means playing— 
Augh, I'm surrounded!

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:34.910
You shouldn't play such games, Miss. 
You're too young.

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:34.060
Take that and that!

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:36.410
It's fine.

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:38.410
Maria-san will scold you.

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:40.350
It's fine, it's fine!

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:46.490
Looks like it wasn't fine at all.

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:29.000
Why am I up at this hour?

00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:36.760
Darn it, now I'm wide awake.

00:02:42.280 --> 00:02:43.810
What nice weather.

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:50.140
Talk about a major discovery. 
I never knew mornings felt so nice.

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:51.690
I've gotta show Hayate—

00:02:52.970 --> 00:02:54.490
It's not even 5 o'clock yet.

00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:57.640
I couldn't wake up Maria 
to have her make breakfast.

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:01.320
This smell...

00:03:05.570 --> 00:03:06.200
Delicious.

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:08.340
Oh? Delicious, is it?

00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:12.960
Uh, you don't have to act 
like you saw a ghost...

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:16.270
G-Good morning, Miss Nagi.

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:19.120
What's the matter? 
It's only 5 o'clock in the morning.

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:21.780
I just woke up for some reason.

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:25.490
So, do you get up this 
early every morning?

00:03:25.870 --> 00:03:29.270
Yes, I always wake up and start 
on the meal preparations.

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:32.210
Wow, you're amazing, Hayate.

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:34.760
You're more like a mother than 
the old ladies I see around town.

00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:35.680
Right...

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:38.740
More importantly, 
what brings you here, Miss?

00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:42.770
Oh, uh, no particular reason...

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:48.240
Oh, your hunger woke you up.

00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:52.000
No! I just happened to 
wake up early! It's true!

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:55.290
But I'm still in the 
middle of preparations.

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:57.750
Breakfast won't be 
ready for a while yet.

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:02.740
You don't have to look like 
the world is ending...

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:05.720
Well, just wait a bit longer.

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:12.020
Still, I'm surprised 
you woke up so early.

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:14.320
It even led me to a new discovery.

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:15.810
Oh? What sort of discovery?

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:18.320
Mornings are really nice!

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:21.610
The air is so clear, 
and it feels great!

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:23.620
That's your discovery?

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:25.950
Yeah. Something wrong with that?

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:30.290
No, I just thought you really 
need to reform your lifestyle...

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:34.750
Here you go. 
It's egg and tomato stir-fry.

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:37.670
Does this actually taste good?

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:41.250
It's quick and delicious for 
when you need a bite to eat.

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:44.260
But eating egg and tomato 
together sounds...

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:49.600
What is this?! It's really good!

00:04:50.630 --> 00:04:51.270
You see?

00:04:52.800 --> 00:04:56.840
The tartness of the tomatoes brings 
out the sweetness of the eggs.

00:04:56.840 --> 00:04:58.470
It's because the 
ingredients are so good.

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:01.280
Maria-san raised both 
the eggs and the tomatoes.

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:03.200
She's good at it, so their flavors

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:05.400
are entirely different 
from what you're used to.

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:08.290
Maria really is something.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:13.180
I should get up early more often!

00:05:13.180 --> 00:05:16.290
They say the early riser 
gets the three mon.

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:18.300
How much is three mon worth?

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:20.940
In terms of modern 
currency, about 30 yen.

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:22.280
That's just sad.

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:25.630
I'd rather go back to sleep 
than get 30 yen any day.

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:33.090
Hey, Hayate, isn't this 
coffee stronger than usual?

00:05:33.090 --> 00:05:37.710
Uh, well... if I didn't 
make it stronger...

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:42.760
Hey! You thought I'd get sleepy 
since I just ate, didn't you?!

00:05:42.760 --> 00:05:46.400
Well, I didn't want you to fall 
asleep right after eating...

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:48.960
You underestimate me!

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:51.530
Do I look like such a 
simple creature... to...

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:57.910
That wasn't what it looked like! 
I just felt a sneeze coming!

00:05:58.470 --> 00:06:00.220
Yes, of course.

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:03.860
W-Well, anyway, I need to 
check the late night anime

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:05.760
I recorded overnight, so I'm leaving!

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:09.410
And I'm gonna wash my face, 
but not to wake myself up!

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:11.640
G-Good luck.

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:16.800
<i>Espers are people who possess psychic powers.</i>

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:17.080
Darn that Hayate, making fun of me...

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:21.610
<i>This is an anime about special esper girls 
who particularly love chilled foods,</i>

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:18.930
I'm not going to get sleepy now...

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:24.710
<i>presented along with the smell of curry!</i>

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:28.820
<i>Zettai Curry - Chilled, Even?</i>

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:33.080
Crap! I lost consciousness for a second!

00:06:33.380 --> 00:06:34.600
It's no use.

00:06:34.600 --> 00:06:37.580
I need to move around 
a little to wake myself up.

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:41.420
Spread the arms out wide 
to stretch the back!

00:06:41.760 --> 00:06:44.510
Twist the body to the side and back...

00:06:44.510 --> 00:06:46.580
One, two, three, four...

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:48.760
One, two, three, four...

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:51.420
<i>Hey, I think my body feels revitalized!</i>

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:53.180
<i>So this is the effect 
of radio calisthenics!</i>

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:55.080
<i>This is great!</i>

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:58.230
<i>It's like the birds and the 
morning sun are blessing me!</i>

00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:01.790
<i>Mornings really do feel good.</i>

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:04.720
<i>Okay, maybe I'll make it a new custom 
to get up early from now on!</i>

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:11.290
Well... This makes me less sleepy, 
but it's pretty tiring...

00:07:12.350 --> 00:07:15.580
I don't know if I can last 
the day if I'm this tired.

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:18.080
Maybe I should take a little break...

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:24.660
<i>Why is she in different clothes 
than the ones she fell asleep in?</i>

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:27.400
Good morning, Hayate-kun.

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:30.470
Oh, good morning, Maria-san. 
Where's Miss Nagi?

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:33.200
Still asleep, of course. Why?

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:36.080
<i>This is the afternoon news.</i>

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:38.510
<i>We've received a report that the</i>

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:39.810
So you ended up going back to sleep.

00:07:38.510 --> 00:07:40.220
<i>polar bear that couldn't swim has</i>

00:07:40.220 --> 00:07:44.020
<i>overcome his fear of water after 
ten years of rigorous practice.</i>

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:41.940
I didn't go back to sleep. I took a nap.

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:44.450
Well, they say the sleeping child grows well.

00:07:44.450 --> 00:07:46.310
Don't treat me like a kid!

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:45.720
<i>Now for our next story.</i>

00:07:46.370 --> 00:07:49.970
<i>The disorderly lifestyles of children 
have recently become a growing concern.</i>

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:53.850
<b>Children's "Lifestyle Disorder"</b>

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:53.850
<b>"Early to Bed, Early to Rise" Project</b>

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:51.290
<i>The board of education encourages</i>

00:07:51.290 --> 00:07:54.350
<i>families to make an effort to 
sleep early and wake up early—</i>

00:07:55.610 --> 00:07:57.270
I did wake up early!

00:07:57.270 --> 00:07:59.910
If only this had been a school day.

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:02.440
Oh, yeah... it's Sunday.

00:08:03.340 --> 00:08:04.580
I'm so bored.

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:07.600
It's nice out, so maybe 
I'll go rent some DVDs.

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:09.760
Doujinshi & Games       Come on in!

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:09.760
<b>Comic</b>

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:09.760
<b>Tachibana</b>

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:12.760
<b>Naked Emanuelle</b>

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:16.280
Miss?

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:18.920
Wh-What?

00:08:18.920 --> 00:08:20.510
The anime corner is over there.

00:08:20.510 --> 00:08:22.170
S-So what?!

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:23.730
So what...?

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:27.020
You think it's strange for me
 to choose a regular movie?!

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:28.220
Go over there!

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:28.980
Right...

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:31.840
Does he think anime is all I watch?

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:33.490
I'm not a kid.

00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:38.120
<b>Naked Emanuelle</b>

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:38.120
<i>But what is an R-18 rated 
movie doing here?</i>

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:41.810
<i>Some spaz probably returned 
it to the wrong shelf.</i>

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:42.870
<i>Inexcusable.</i>

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:44.700
<i>Absolutely inexcusable.</i>

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:46.650
<i>You can't put something like this 
on a shelf children can rea—</i>

00:08:46.030 --> 00:08:47.680
Are you ever gonna decide?

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:51.170
All those movies are old. 
Can't you just pick one from the title?

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:54.860
Shut up! It's better to 
look at the package first!

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:56.110
Is it?

00:08:56.110 --> 00:08:58.010
You just get back to work!

00:09:00.460 --> 00:09:04.390
<b>Naked Emanuelle</b>

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:04.390
<i>R-18... The forbidden world 
that children mustn't see...</i>

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:08.930
<i>What if a child 
accidentally rented this,</i>

00:09:08.930 --> 00:09:12.450
<i>and it had a major influence 
on their character development?</i>

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:15.130
<i>To prevent such a mistake 
from happening...</i>

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:17.110
Miss, have you chosen yet?

00:09:17.840 --> 00:09:20.300
N-Not yet! Just wait outside!

00:09:20.850 --> 00:09:22.160
Get out of here right now!

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:23.620
<b>Pay Here</b>

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:27.030
You're renting all these?

00:09:27.030 --> 00:09:28.130
G-Got a problem?

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:31.880
Why don't you just buy them?

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:33.320
I can't buy these!

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:36.100
N-Never mind.

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:37.220
Okay, fine...

00:09:39.420 --> 00:09:40.220
All according to plan!

00:09:41.050 --> 00:09:42.530
I'm back.

00:09:42.530 --> 00:09:44.850
Oh, Hayate-kun, Nagi isn't with you?

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:48.330
No. She said she wants to concentrate,

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:50.380
so I should leave her alone for a while.

00:09:51.490 --> 00:09:53.730
What is this inexcusable DVD?

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:57.860
It was mixed in with regular the DVDs, 
so I rented it by <i>accident</i>!

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:00.800
By accident! 
I don't even want to watch it!

00:10:01.690 --> 00:10:04.540
Well, if you say so, Shiranui, 
then I have no choice.

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:08.500
It would be rude to the filmmakers
 to return it without watching it!

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:12.420
Very well. However inexcusable,
 we should watch it together!

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:14.170
<b>Vattalion</b>

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:17.170
This doesn't look like the same 
title I saw in the store.

00:10:18.870 --> 00:10:21.680
Did I get flustered and 
grab the wrong one?

00:10:22.270 --> 00:10:25.320
Well, it's also rated R-18, 
so it's all the same.

00:10:25.370 --> 00:10:26.930
<b>Vattalion</b>

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:31.610
Stupid Nagi, 
making a mess of our store...

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:33.690
But she rented lots of DVDs.

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:35.490
Too many!

00:10:35.490 --> 00:10:38.010
I even accidentally let her 
rent an R-18 DVD with them!

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:39.420
What?! You mean...

00:10:39.420 --> 00:10:41.450
It wasn't porn! It was Vattalion.

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:43.200
Vattalion?

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:47.710
A horror film that became 
a social phenomenon in the '80s.

00:10:48.270 --> 00:10:49.710
Is it scary?

00:10:50.090 --> 00:10:51.430
Yeah, it's scary.

00:10:51.430 --> 00:10:54.710
So scary, you can't stop 
watching once you've started.

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:59.010
<b>5 Minutes</b>

00:10:55.150 --> 00:10:57.170
First, a zombie that came from a

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:59.010
lost army project is 
accidentally released.

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:03.430
<b>20 Minutes</b>

00:10:59.570 --> 00:11:01.140
They burn the zombie, 
and the smoke causes a

00:11:01.140 --> 00:11:03.430
whole horde of zombies to 
rise from their graves.

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:05.160
Then there's a somewhat erotic scene!

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:06.220
<b>40 Minutes</b>

00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:07.230
Then Tarman goes on a rampage!
 Super scary!

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:09.020
<b>60 Minutes</b>

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:10.910
And then, the shocking ending!

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:13.360
<b>90 Minutes</b>

00:11:14.680 --> 00:11:16.880
I-It was surprisingly interesting,

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:18.820
so I ended up watching 
the whole thing, but...

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:21.300
What was the deal with 
that super scary movie?!

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:24.200
Are all horror movies that scary?!

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:31.520
Hayate!

00:11:34.270 --> 00:11:37.250
Um... Is something wrong, Miss?

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:39.860
I can't beat this without you!

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:41.630
Huh? Beat what?

00:11:41.910 --> 00:11:43.890
It... It's a secret.

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:47.140
<i>Watching R-18 movies 
really is a bad idea.</i>

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:49.640
<i>Now that I've opened 
the forbidden door,</i>

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:52.390
<i>I can't go on living alone.</i>

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:55.720
I don't know what happened,

00:11:56.140 --> 00:11:58.900
but I would never leave you alone.

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:00.370
Hayate...

00:12:01.420 --> 00:12:05.080
Hayate-kun, would you go buy some 
additional groceries for me?

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:06.620
Yes, right away.

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:10.010
You were about to leave me alone!

00:12:10.010 --> 00:12:13.270
But, I can't be with you 24 hours a day—

00:12:13.270 --> 00:12:15.880
You have to be with me 24 hours a day!

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:18.990
I... I never know when 
it's going to show up!

00:12:18.990 --> 00:12:20.940
But Maria-san will be here.

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:23.030
Maria can't beat this!

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:23.880
But...

00:12:24.290 --> 00:12:27.490
That would mean I'd be with you 
even when you're sleeping.

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:32.180
Why are you here, Hayate-kun?

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:33.490
Beats me...

00:12:33.490 --> 00:12:35.350
Just for today! It's just for today!

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:39.740
Well, I can't imagine anything would 
happen if you sleep together,

00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:42.140
but Hayate-kun is a boy, after all...

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:45.320
Th-Then, until I fall asleep!

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:47.230
Just until I fall asleep!

00:12:47.230 --> 00:12:49.280
I guess there's no changing your mind.

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:51.270
Okay, but go right to sleep.

00:12:53.340 --> 00:12:55.480
So, are you asleep, Nagi?

00:12:55.480 --> 00:12:57.120
N-Not yet. A little longer.

00:12:57.470 --> 00:12:59.290
Are you asleep, Miss?

00:12:59.950 --> 00:13:01.250
I'm trying!

00:13:01.250 --> 00:13:04.930
By the way, Hayate-kun, 
how has Nagi been lately?

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:08.960
Well... We went to 
Wataru-kun's store today,

00:13:08.960 --> 00:13:13.140
and she was staring at a DVD with 
a naked woman on the package.

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:17.060
Do you think I should caution 
her in such situations?

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:21.440
We certainly don't want any influences 
on her character development.

00:13:22.310 --> 00:13:26.320
A lot of the manga she's been 
reading have been extreme, too.

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:28.290
What a problem...

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:30.340
So, Miss...

00:13:30.340 --> 00:13:31.450
Are you asleep now?

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:36.000
Who can sleep with that kind of 
conversation happening on both sides?!

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:40.290
It looks like she finally fell asleep.

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:42.530
I'll take my leave now.

00:13:42.530 --> 00:13:44.300
Okay. Thank you for staying so late.

00:13:45.350 --> 00:13:49.300
Scary... Scary guys 
are coming... Hayate...

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:53.870
Hi-yah! Take that!

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:55.480
Worry not, Miss.

00:13:55.840 --> 00:13:58.500
I defeated all the scary guys.

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:01.690
So just relax and sleep in peace.

00:14:02.970 --> 00:14:04.450
Well, goodnight.

00:14:04.450 --> 00:14:06.280
Goodnight, Hayate-kun.

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:10.910
I see. So this is it?

00:14:11.730 --> 00:14:14.470
She was so scared because 
she watched this?

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:18.170
Really, what a handful she is...

00:14:19.810 --> 00:14:21.970
Is it really that scary?

00:14:24.240 --> 00:14:26.340
Uh, Maria-san...

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:29.090
<b>Commercial Connecting Theater</b>

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:29.090
It's Commercial Connecting Theater!

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:31.480
So apparently "negitoro" isn't named that because

00:14:31.480 --> 00:14:33.100
it's tuna meat with onions?

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:35.950
Nope. It's named "negitoro" after the way

00:14:35.950 --> 00:14:38.230
they cut the meat from the tuna's body.

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:41.210
I'm impressed, Miss! You knew that?

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:42.110
Of course!

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:46.520
By the way, scrubbing isn't called 
"akasuri" because it scrubs grime off the skin.

00:14:46.520 --> 00:14:50.100
It's called that because 
the skin turns red when scrubbed.

00:14:50.100 --> 00:14:52.120
Wow, I never knew that!

00:14:52.420 --> 00:14:53.700
Well, that one's not true.

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:55.880
What?! It's not true?!

00:14:55.880 --> 00:14:57.630
Why would you lie about that?!

00:14:57.910 --> 00:15:00.830
<b>Commercial Connecting Theater</b>

00:14:58.880 --> 00:15:00.830
It's Commercial Connecting Theater!

00:15:01.360 --> 00:15:02.640
The millionaire mackerel.

00:15:02.640 --> 00:15:05.150
A very rare and precious fish.

00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:08.590
Because they are very small and weak,
 they frequently die.

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:11.060
They are generally always 
in a foul mood and

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:12.290
don't like being in groups.

00:15:12.290 --> 00:15:13.470
But since they are weak,

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:16.600
they can't catch food without help,
 so they frequently die.

00:15:17.260 --> 00:15:19.150
They're cowards, but they also

00:15:19.150 --> 00:15:21.420
hate to lose and boldly 
take on large foes,

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:24.450
but being so weak, they immediately 
lose and frequently die.

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:28.090
This fish really is a 
lot like Miss Nagi.

00:15:28.520 --> 00:15:30.150
You're right.

00:15:34.970 --> 00:15:36.480
I'm taking today off.

00:15:36.480 --> 00:15:39.290
Hey! Why are you getting so down 
right at the start of the B part?

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:42.560
Shut up! My dictionary says 
I get to be late when it's windy,

00:15:42.560 --> 00:15:44.700
and I get to stay home 
when it's raining!

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:47.050
What southern island made you its king?

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:51.710
The point is, I can't go to school 
on a soggy day like this!

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:56.350
So, she's confined 
herself to her futon.

00:15:57.000 --> 00:15:58.870
There's no helping this child...

00:15:59.340 --> 00:16:00.740
What should we do?

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:05.270
Well, I have shopping to do, 
so I'll leave the rest to you, Hayate-kun.

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:07.120
M-Maria-san!

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:11.960
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:16:11.960 --> 00:16:13.880
<i>Miss Sanzenin Nagi is lazy, 
finds everything a bother,</i>

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:15.620
<i>loafs around more than a cat,</i>

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:17.390
<i>and in her past life, 
she was probably a koala</i>

00:16:17.390 --> 00:16:19.510
<i>that was known for being 
especially unmotivated,</i>

00:16:19.510 --> 00:16:21.940
<i>even among koalas that are famous 
for sleeping 20 hours per day.</i>

00:16:21.940 --> 00:16:24.880
<i>So how am I supposed to 
get her to go to school?</i>

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:26.790
Don't insult me in monologue!

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:28.800
Then, let's go to school.

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:30.230
No.

00:16:30.230 --> 00:16:32.440
You came all the way out here 
because you always end up

00:16:32.440 --> 00:16:34.440
loafing around in the mansion, right?

00:16:34.440 --> 00:16:35.930
It's the rain's fault.

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:37.220
Miss Nagi...

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:39.560
Why are you lying around like this?

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:42.760
Because I'm just an 
unmotivated koala, right?

00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:44.060
Sleeping is the only talent I have.

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:48.270
Oh, come on. You got up early 
the other day, didn't you?

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:50.510
It was a fluke! It won't happen again!

00:16:50.510 --> 00:16:52.940
But they say the early riser 
gets the three mon,

00:16:52.940 --> 00:16:56.820
so if you go to school in the rain, 
maybe you'll get about 30 mon.

00:16:57.090 --> 00:16:59.160
As if I'd risk my life 
for 300 measly yen!

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:02.630
You're exaggerating. 
It's only going to school.

00:17:02.630 --> 00:17:03.580
I can't!

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:08.230
I don't have the will 
or the stamina anymore.

00:17:08.230 --> 00:17:09.300
Miss Nagi?

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:13.520
I have to draw something new by 
the next doujinshi exhibition,

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:17.230
but I don't know what to draw now.

00:17:17.960 --> 00:17:21.100
So I'm going to distance myself 
from manga for a while.

00:17:21.550 --> 00:17:25.350
I want to take another look 
at myself and figure out

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:27.730
what I can draw again.

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:29.110
Miss Nagi...

00:17:29.540 --> 00:17:31.850
That's why I need sleep.

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:33.610
I should never have asked!

00:17:34.460 --> 00:17:35.400
<i>It's no use.</i>

00:17:36.460 --> 00:17:37.610
<i>If this keeps up...</i>

00:17:39.820 --> 00:17:41.830
She won't go to school, 
and she'll just loaf

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:43.320
around, both here and at the mansion.

00:17:43.690 --> 00:17:48.400
I can't give her the dishonor of 
being called "the moving recluse."

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:49.630
What do I do?

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:54.060
Then, shall I teach you the surefire 
way to move Nagi's heart?

00:17:54.060 --> 00:17:55.130
That voice...

00:17:55.690 --> 00:17:56.740
Isumi-san!

00:17:58.070 --> 00:18:01.280
Wait, is it okay for you 
to be missing school, too?

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:04.930
I wanted to go, but I don't know 
where the school is...

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:07.770
You still haven't 
learned the way there?

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:10.230
Well, anyway, what's this "surefire way"?

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:13.690
The surefire way to move 
Nagi's heart is...

00:18:14.180 --> 00:18:15.270
A famous quote!

00:18:16.440 --> 00:18:17.760
A quote?

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:22.830
Despite appearances, she is easily 
influenced by many things,

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:26.450
so if you say something that fits the situation, 
her attitude will change.

00:18:27.020 --> 00:18:29.250
In other words, 
she's very simple-minded.

00:18:29.560 --> 00:18:30.830
I get it...

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:32.630
But will that really work?

00:18:33.220 --> 00:18:35.630
Why not try it and find out?

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:45.100
<b>Murmurs</b>

00:18:38.530 --> 00:18:42.250
Don't try hard starting tomorrow. 
Try hard starting today.

00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:45.100
Tomorrow will only come to 
those who try hard today.

00:18:51.910 --> 00:18:53.570
You were so close.

00:18:54.010 --> 00:18:56.110
Yeah... But I see how to do it now.

00:18:56.400 --> 00:19:00.140
Now I just need to gather some 
inspiring quotes and try them on her.

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:03.280
Quotes, eh?

00:19:03.670 --> 00:19:05.120
Please help me, Hinagiku-san.

00:19:05.600 --> 00:19:07.620
Then, I'll tell you my favorite.

00:19:08.820 --> 00:19:10.680
You must sit on a rock 
for three years!

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:17.790
Even a cold, hard rock will warm up 
if you sit on it for three years.

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:20.400
Yes, being human is all about effort!

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:22.470
No matter how painful life gets,

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:26.350
if you keep trying your hardest, 
your effort will be rewarded!

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:28.230
Effort! Effort!

00:19:30.030 --> 00:19:31.940
That one's a little too 
advanced for Miss Nagi...

00:19:32.320 --> 00:19:35.690
Oh, I know what you mean! 
Like Lassie and Rin Tin Tin, right?

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:36.820
Those are famous dogs, not quotes.

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:39.320
Then you mean like the 
"16 shots per second"

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:40.980
guy with the bee logo, Takahashi-san!

00:19:40.980 --> 00:19:42.160
That's a famous master.

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:44.080
There's only one truth!

00:19:44.080 --> 00:19:45.330
That's a famous detective.

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:49.270
Um... Guaranteed win at the races! 
Click here to find out how!

00:19:49.270 --> 00:19:51.040
That's just email spam!

00:19:51.320 --> 00:19:53.210
I'm not sure I know any quotes...

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:55.540
Don't you know anything I can say

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:57.500
to move Miss Nagi's heart enough

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:59.050
to make her go to school in the rain?

00:19:59.290 --> 00:20:03.320
Is it that big of a challenge 
to go to school in the rain?

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:05.830
It is for Miss Nagi.

00:20:06.420 --> 00:20:08.560
I see... Well, then...

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:11.990
Miss Nagi, let's just 
try to go to school.

00:20:12.400 --> 00:20:13.550
I don't have the will.

00:20:13.550 --> 00:20:15.130
I could barely manage to play

00:20:15.130 --> 00:20:16.900
Segagaga Sanshiro on Dreamnyast right now.

00:20:17.210 --> 00:20:19.580
You have plenty of will...

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:23.410
Listen to this. 
These are Chiharu-san's words.

00:20:25.710 --> 00:20:28.040
Losers are losers 
no matter what they do!

00:20:29.760 --> 00:20:32.070
Don't you call me a loser!

00:20:32.070 --> 00:20:33.790
I didn't mean that!

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:37.000
I meant you're not that big of a loser,
 so you should try and...

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:38.960
What do you mean, 
not <i>that big</i> a loser?!

00:20:39.830 --> 00:20:40.710
I meant...

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:42.860
I'm just going to waste this day.

00:20:42.860 --> 00:20:45.680
I'm going to skip school 
and waste this whole day.

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:47.510
M-Miss Nagi!

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:50.610
You still haven't left?

00:20:50.610 --> 00:20:51.860
I'm sorry.

00:20:51.860 --> 00:20:56.070
Do you have any quotes 
to motivate her, Maria-san?

00:20:56.070 --> 00:20:57.400
Quotes?

00:20:57.780 --> 00:21:00.030
Hmph! No words will move me!

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:02.760
Let's see...

00:21:04.270 --> 00:21:05.530
Then, let's try this.

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:08.480
Money?

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:10.390
How much is there?

00:21:10.390 --> 00:21:14.380
Uh... there's 24,262 yen.

00:21:14.380 --> 00:21:17.290
You want me to use this to 
buy another Dreamnyast?

00:21:17.780 --> 00:21:21.300
No. That money represents life.

00:21:21.870 --> 00:21:22.870
Life?

00:21:23.250 --> 00:21:25.290
If one day is one yen,

00:21:25.290 --> 00:21:29.050
then that amount represents your 
life if you live to age 80.

00:21:30.430 --> 00:21:32.670
About 24,000 yen is all 
the time you have left.

00:21:32.670 --> 00:21:36.940
Turn your days into yen, 
and you only have

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:39.320
about enough to buy one game console.

00:21:40.140 --> 00:21:43.890
If you think you can afford 
to waste any of that,

00:21:43.890 --> 00:21:47.570
then feel free to use a thousand or ten, 
however you please.

00:21:48.540 --> 00:21:52.540
This money has been given to you, 
and the amount will never increase.

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:55.460
What you spend it on is up to you.

00:21:56.830 --> 00:21:58.460
My life...?

00:21:58.740 --> 00:22:00.920
Okay, I'll just take one yen...

00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:01.920
No!

00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:06.590
Get moving, Hayate!

00:22:07.940 --> 00:22:10.260
You think I can afford to laze 
around just because it's raining?!

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:12.340
We're going to school, Hayate!

00:22:12.690 --> 00:22:13.930
R-Right!

00:22:14.990 --> 00:22:16.940
You said the early riser 
gets the three mon,

00:22:17.340 --> 00:22:20.710
and the one who goes to school 
in the rain gets 30 mon, right?

00:22:20.710 --> 00:22:22.150
That's right, Miss.

00:22:22.150 --> 00:22:24.660
So I'm taking the trouble to go.

00:22:24.660 --> 00:22:28.490
I can't wait to see what 
that 30 mon is worth!

00:22:28.490 --> 00:22:30.440
You said it, Miss!

00:24:05.840 --> 00:24:07.710
You're up next! Make it good!

00:24:07.710 --> 00:24:10.290
I had the name Athena Tennousu...

00:24:10.290 --> 00:24:12.190
But, um, it's Alice now...

00:24:12.190 --> 00:24:13.780
That's not important here!

00:24:13.780 --> 00:24:14.950
Nice Cutie!

00:24:14.950 --> 00:24:16.320
C-Cutie Mate!

00:24:16.320 --> 00:24:16.930
Hey!

00:24:16.930 --> 00:24:19.240
You know, I could get used to this!
